{"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/RetainedHistoryAndResources"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit"],["doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/RecoveryAndStorage"],["doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/AppKitIntegration","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/RecoveryAndStorage"],["doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HostingYourModel","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/RecoveryAndStorage"],["doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/InstallingUndoKit","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/RecoveryAndStorage"],["doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/SwiftUIIntegration","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/RecoveryAndStorage"],["doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/UIKitIntegration","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/RecoveryAndStorage"]]},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Recovery and retained history","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/RecoveryAndStorage","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/PreviewCompatibilityAndSupport","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryFailure","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryReading","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryRetentionManaging"],"anchor":"Recovery-and-retained-history"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Read narrowly","type":"heading","anchor":"Read-narrowly","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Give browsers "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryReading","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and policy owners "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryRetentionManaging","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Metadata pages do not decode every state. A Checkpoint is a host-designated opaque"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state reference; the host owns semantic completeness and required dependencies."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A new edit after Undo can retire ordinary Redo eligibility while retaining the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"displaced continuation’s history."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryRecoveryPlan","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" to obtain a coherent bounded sequence of opaque","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accepted-effect transitions. Release the plan when complete or cancelled. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"host retrieves required codecs\/resources, reconstructs an isolated state and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"validates it. Reading or reconstruction does not restore live content. To adopt","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the result, submit a new Command carrying its restoration origin."}]},{"text":"Protect what recovery needs","type":"heading","anchor":"Protect-what-recovery-needs","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"State protection and detailed-history protection are distinct promises. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Checkpoint or state hold preserves state dependencies; a detailed hold can retain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the transition material needed for further browsing\/reconstruction. Resource","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"references identify host-owned bytes; UndoKit does not copy or interpret their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"meaning. Preserve required host codecs and resources while retained history,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"active plans or pending work can still reference them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Run bounded retention\/consolidation maintenance under the selected host policy."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Whole Undo Groups must remain coherent; ordinary depth is not a count of individual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"members. Physical resource cleanup belongs to the store-wide fence because other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scopes can retain the same host objects. Do not infer that loss of Undo availability"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"permits deleting retained History or shared resources."}]},{"text":"Recording and continuity","type":"heading","anchor":"Recording-and-continuity","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Recording-Off changes are undoable in the open session, but the first accepted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Off change creates a gap that cannot be crossed to older ordinary Actions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Re-enabling recording adopts a coherent host baseline. Earlier retained states"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"may still be read under their existing codec\/resource requirements."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Clearing settled history establishes a new generation. A quarantined unresolved"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reset requires independent knowledge of current domain state and an explicit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host decision; it is not ordinary error handling. Delayed requests bound to a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retired generation must be refused before delivery."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"Retained history, checkpoints and resources","modules":[{"name":"UndoKit"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Browsing retained History does not move ordinary Undo\/Redo position."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/undokit\/retainedhistoryandresources"]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryReading","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryRetentionManaging","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryRecoveryPlan","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryStore"],"anchor":"Topics"}],"references":{"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/InstallingUndoKit":{"url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/installingundokit","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/InstallingUndoKit","kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Installing UndoKit","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Select one dynamic runtime and resource owner per process."}]},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/undokit","title":"UndoKit","abstract":[{"text":"Durable Undo and Redo for Swift apps, with the native editing behavior people expect.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/HistoryRetentionManaging":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"HistoryRetentionManaging"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryRetentionManaging","url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/historyretentionmanaging","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HistoryRetentionManaging"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Host-directed checkpoint, hold and consolidation operations for one History Scope."}],"title":"HistoryRetentionManaging"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/HistoryRecoveryPlan":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryRecoveryPlan","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"HistoryRecoveryPlan"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HistoryRecoveryPlan"}],"url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/historyrecoveryplan","title":"HistoryRecoveryPlan","abstract":[{"text":"An open-session handle. Release it when reconstruction finishes or is cancelled.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/SwiftUIIntegration":{"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/SwiftUIIntegration","url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/swiftuiintegration","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Let SwiftUI compose the screen while a stable owner retains the editor, binding and session."}],"title":"Present native history in SwiftUI"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/HistoryReading":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"HistoryReading"}],"url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/historyreading","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HistoryReading"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryReading","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"HistoryReading","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Bounded historical reads, presentation and host-directed reconstruction."}]},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/RecoveryAndStorage":{"url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/recoveryandstorage","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/RecoveryAndStorage","kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Recovery, storage and concurrency","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Preserve exact intent and authoritative evidence across uncertainty."}]},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/HostingYourModel":{"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HostingYourModel","url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/hostingyourmodel","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Replace the example’s domain host while keeping session and presentation wiring."}],"title":"Connect your own model"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/AppKitIntegration":{"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/AppKitIntegration","url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/appkitintegration","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Bind native text views to a document’s typed operations and route the window’s UndoManager."}],"title":"Add history to an AppKit window"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/HistoryStore":{"abstract":[{"text":"Physical owner of a registered SQLite history store and its independent scopes.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The host chooses and coordinates the location. A writable session holds one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"exclusive owner lock; readers may inspect committed records concurrently."}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"HistoryStore","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"HistoryStore","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/historystore","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HistoryStore","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryStore","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/UIKitIntegration":{"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/UIKitIntegration","url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/uikitintegration","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep a native text view and its history binding with the scene’s document presentation."}],"title":"Add history to a UIKit scene"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/HistoryFailure":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"HistoryFailure"}],"url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/historyfailure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HistoryFailure"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistoryFailure","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A typed failure. Underlying text is diagnostic and never changes the disposition."}],"type":"topic","title":"HistoryFailure"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/PreviewCompatibilityAndSupport":{"kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/PreviewCompatibilityAndSupport","url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/previewcompatibilityandsupport","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Distinguish intended support, actual qualification and published identity."}],"title":"Beta compatibility and support"}}}